{!Contact.FirstName},

National College Decision day is right around the corner! Have you decided where you will be attending this fall? If you are still considering Arizona State University, you have until May 1st to pay the enrollment deposit to begin your housing and orientation selection! This all can be done through your My ASU page under “Important Next Steps.”

You should have your financial aid package available on the “Finances” tab. If you have questions regarding tuition, I have found the websites below to be useful to determine if ASU in the right financial fit in addition to being the right academic fit. 

Tuition Estimator
Housing Costs
Student Budget Worksheet

If you haven’t quite made the decision yet, please let me know if I can be of assistance. I am happy to answer any questions you may have about ASU!

If you have chosen a different institution at this time and are no longer pursuing ASU as an option, also let me know so that I can provide you with instructions on how to cancel your admission. 

We hope to welcome you to our Sun Devil Family!
Justin